### steam-fix-trayicon

[![License: MIT](https://img.shields.io/badge/License-MIT-blue.svg)](https://github.com/bosmak/copr/blob/main/steam-fix-trayicon/LICENSE)

Replacement Steam tray icon for Wayland desktops: **double click opens the Steam window**, single click still opens Steam's own menu.

> **Made for DuxShell** (formerly DankMaterialShell / DMS) and only tested
> on **niri**. DuxShell runs on several Wayland compositors, but only niri was
> exercised here — other shells may need the single-click menu path adjusted.

```sh
sudo dnf install steam-fix-trayicon
```

Source: <https://github.com/bosmak/copr/tree/main/steam-fix-trayicon>

